ADA KETENTUAN BATASAN WAKTU BAGI ODGJ DALAM MENGIKUTI PROGRAM TERSEBUT?", "answer_type": "SINGLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 90, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "", "keterangan": "", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SD", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:24.974Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:36:07.230Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 317, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SDQ8", "question_text": "SEBERAPA INTENSIF ODGJ MENGIKUTI PELATIHAN KETERAMPILAN, AKTIVITAS KREATIF (SENI ATAU MUSIK), SERTA KEGIATAN KELOMPOK?", "answer_type": "SINGLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 91, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "BAIK, KARENA BAPAK/IBU TADI MENYAMPAIKAN BAHWA FASILITAS INI MENYEDIAKAN PELATIHAN KETERAMPILAN, AKTIVITAS KREATIF (SENI ATAU MUSIK), SERTA KEGIATAN KELOMPOK, SELANJUTNYA SAYA AKAN MENANYAKAN TERKAIT INTENSITAS LAYANAN TERSEBUT.", "keterangan": "", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SD", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:24.991Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:37:11.342Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 318, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SDQ9", "question_text": "APA SAJA FOKUS LAYANAN PELATIHAN KETERAMPILAN, AKTIVITAS, SERTA KEGIATAN KELOMPOK TERSEBUT?", "answer_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 92, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "", "keterangan": "JAWABAN BOLEH LEBIH DARI SATU", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SD", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:24.999Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:38:05.002Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 319, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SDQ10", "question_text": "APA SAJA FOKUS LAYANAN PELATIHAN KETERAMPILAN, AKTIVITAS, SERTA KEGIATAN KELOMPOK TERSEBUT?", "answer_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 93, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "", "keterangan": "JAWABAN BOLEH LEBIH DARI SATU", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SD", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:25.011Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:38:43.970Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 320, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SDQ11", "question_text": "SEBERAPA INTENSIF ODGJ MENGIKUTI KEGIATAN LAYANAN JARINGAN PERTEMANAN, PEMBERIAN NASIHAT, DAN/ATAU DUKUNGAN BAGI ODGJ/KELUARGA TERSEBUT?", "answer_type": "SINGLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 94, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "BAIK, KARENA BAPAK/IBU TADI MENYAMPAIKAN BAHWA FASILITAS INI MENYEDIAKAN JARINGAN PERTEMANAN, PEMBERIAN NASIHAT, DAN/ATAU DUKUNGAN BAGI ODGJ/KELUARGA, SELANJUTNYA SAYA AKAN MENANYAKAN TERKAIT INTENSITAS LAYANAN TERSEBUT.", "keterangan": "", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SD", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:25.042Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:39:32.530Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 321, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SOQ1", "question_text": "BAGAIMANA LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN TERSEBUT DIBERIKAN?", "answer_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 95, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "SAYA AKAN MENANYAKAN BEBERAPA HAL TERKAIT DENGAN LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN KARENA BAPAK/IBU TADI MENJAWAB BAHWA FASILITAS INI MEMILIKI LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN.\n\nLAYANAN RAWAT JALAN ADALAH LAYANAN YANG MEMBERIKAN PENANGANAN KONDISI SOSIAL BAGI ODGJ, BAIK ODGJ BARU MAUPUN LAMA, DI MANA SETELAH SELESAI, ODGJ DIPERBOLEHKAN PULANG DI HARI YANG SAMA (TANPA MENGINAP)\n(Kondisi sosial yang memerlukan penanganan misalnya kesulitan mengurus diri atau kesulitan berinteraksi dengan orang lain)", "keterangan": "JAWABAN BOLEH LEBIH DARI SATU", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SO", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:25.075Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:40:40.261Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 322, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SOQ2", "question_text": "BERAPA FREKUENSI LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN BERBASIS KUNJUNGAN BAGI ODGJ BEROPERASI?", "answer_type": "SINGLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 96, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "SAYA AKAN MELANJUTKAN PERTANYAAN TERKAIT LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN YANG DILAKSANAKAN DENGAN CARA MENJANGKAU ODGJ DI LUAR FASILITAS (BERBASIS KUNJUNGAN).", "keterangan": "", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SO", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:25.090Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-09T03:00:47.281Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 323, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SOQ3", "question_text": "APA SAJA FOKUS LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN DI FASILITAS INI?", "answer_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 97, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_description": "", "introduction_text": "", "keterangan": "JAWABAN BOLEH LEBIH DARI SATU", "validation_rules": null, "show_condition": {"value": "SO", "operator": "contains", "question_code": "QL2"}, "skip_logic": null, "table_config": null, "created_at": "2026-03-17T14:35:25.120Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-09T03:01:31.403Z"}}, {"model": "survey.question", "pk": 324, "fields": {"section": 4, "code": "SOQ4", "question_text": "APA SAJA FOKUS LAYANAN RAWAT JALAN DI FASILITAS INI?", "answer_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE", "is_required": true, "order": 98, "mtc_code": null, "desde_ltc_descr